<article class="env-lemma" id="09Q5">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/09Q5">Lemma <span data-tag="09Q5">23.8.7</span>.</a> Let $A$ be a Noetherian ring. Then $A$ is a local complete intersection if and only if $A_\mathfrak m$ is a complete intersection for every maximal ideal $\mathfrak m$ of $A$. </p>
</article><article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      This follows immediately from Lemma <a href="/tag/09Q4" data-tag="09Q4">23.8.6</a> and the definitions. 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
    </p>
</article>